MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The "av1" threshold being used in scantwo compares the best two-locus additive model to the best single-locus model: is there evidence for a second QTL, beyond the first one? In stepwise, we just look at the single-locus threshold. The scantwo approach is much more conservative in your case.

karl

